   "text": "Requirements\n\n- Your army must include at least 1 Khorne Berzerker unit.\n- Your army must include at least 1 Eightbound unit.\n- You may not include an Allied Detachment in your Army.\n- Your army may not include Bike, Cavalry, Aircraft or Vehicle type units that do not have the Transport special rule.\n\nBenefits\n\n- Khorne Berzerker units in your army gain the Blood Hungry special rule.\n- You may field Red Butchers at Troops Choices but they gain the Support Squad special rule.\n- Eightbound become Limited: 3 per Detachment.",
