  {
   "id": "codex/world_eaters/rites_of_war/gorekin_of_khorne",
   "name": "Gorekin of Khorne",
   "page": 13,
   "url": "https://longwarindex.app/rites_of_war/gorekin_of_khorne/",
   "offered_by": {
    "allegiance": "codex/world_eaters/allegiances/allegiance_world_eaters"
   },
   "text": "Requirements\n\n- Your army must include at least 1 unit with the Daemon special rule for every 1000pts.\n- Your army must include a Bloodthirster or Daemon Prince unit.\n- Your army must include at least 1 Cultist Mob.\n\nBenefits\n\n- You may field units from Codex – Chaos Daemons in your Primary Detachment that have the Mark of Khorne.\n- You may field units from Codex – Renegades & Heretics in your Primary Detachment so long as they have the Mark of Khorne.\n- Once per game, select a single enemy unit to be smashed by meteors/flaming skulls. The target unit takes D3+1, Strength 8, AP- Automatic hits. Roll wounds and saves as normal. Cover Saves may not be taken against these hits.",
   "restrictions": [
    {
